  showScore: 0
  dialogues:
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c8fcfa5882242b84b8bf1fb55659059e, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    text: 'Pros: your internal team has been able to thoroughly review 75% of the
      project scopes themselves and extremely comfortable with the project requirements.
      They have fed these requirements into the programme, logistics and supply chain.
      Your client satisfaction increases because they can see your attention to detail,
      and using your internal teams joint knowledge you have closed scope gaps which
      would have been paid out of your profit if discovered later. This could set
      you up quite well for the construction phase...'
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c8fcfa5882242b84b8bf1fb55659059e, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    text: 'Cons: the specialist was very expensive, even with carrying out most of
      the work in house.

'
